window.products.push({"id":123219,"name":"Waterspecialist 4396508 Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for Whirlpool EDR5RXD1, EveryDrop Filter 5, PUR W10186668, 4396510, 4396508P, 4392857, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S83vIIzoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Waterspecialist refrigerator water filter features filtration performance is comparable to the original brand. It is also certified by authority NSF 42 and 372. Far different from generic brand, Waterspecialist only adopts 100% superior coconut shell carbon block to improve taste and odor. Great filtration: Waterspecialist refrigerator filters can reduce many harmful substances in water including chlorine, bad taste and odor and all other major impurities. This has been tested and proven by an independent third-party laboratory. Premium filter material: We also adopt 100% natural coconut shell carbon block that contains larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. Thus, the filter cartridge can efficiently reduce chlorine, bad taste and odor. Perfect fit: Waterspecialist combines precision measurement technology to produce 100% fit refrigerator filters with exquisite engineering designs, unlike inferior replacement filters that can cause water leakage issues. Also, Waterspecialist saves you time and hassle by offering tool-free refrigerator filter replacements. Fresh-tasting water: The 100% natural coconut shell carbon block absorbs more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterspecialist refrigerator filter provides you a unique filtration experience. Waterspecialist selected BPA-free and food-grade filter housing that passed NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. Monthly install stickers: Expired replacement filters might cause an accumulation of pollutants and only achieve low-standard filtration performance. Therefore, Waterspecialist filters come with date labels that remind you to change it on time. Besides, the filter life is 6 months or 300 gallons (varies based on the water condition). Responsibility: Each product manufactured by Waterspecialist, must pass extremely high examination standards. This does not stop when a filter leaves our factory: our 24/7 customer service team will provide water purification solutions and help you answer your questions at any time. Replacement for 4396508, Whirlpool EDR5RXD1, EveryDrop Filter 5, 4396510, NLC240V, 4396508P, 4392857, WF-4396508, 9010, WF-NL240, WF-NLC240V, WF-NL240V, R-9010, 469010, W10186668, 4396508T, 4396509, 4396509P, 4396510P, 4396510T, 4396562, 4396563, 8212491, 4396918, 4396919, 4392857R, 4392922, 46 9902,46 9908, 9902, NL240, WSW-1, Kenmore 46-9010, 46-9902, 46-9908, 8212652, Puriclean IV, 8212652, THERMADOR 491879, 4396547, 4396548, 4396163, 4396164, 2255709, 4396509, 2203220.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S83vIIzoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterspecialist","source_asin":"B078W5R7MC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078W5R7MC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B078W5R7MC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":123220,"name":"Magikan 330R Trash Bag Refills, 72-Feet, 3-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Product Description 3 Pack Refill Liner for Magikan 330 Series. Accordion folded 72 Ft. Long, 18 Micron thick Strong Plastic Tube liner in White color with Spring Flower Scent. Each liner creates 30~40 bags & last up to 4 months. Installation Guide included. Amazon.com This refill pack of trash bags only fits within Magikan trash disposal systems and are specifically sized to fit the 11-gallon can. This 12-month supply includes three 72-foot-long \"endless\" plastic liners that each last for about 3 to 4 months. The novelty of these liners is that they can be cut into a bag of any size in order to dispose of garbage before it becomes odorous. For example, after disposal of food waste or dirty diapers, that portion of the liner can be immediately cut into a bag and hauled outside for curbside pickup while packaging and other nonperishable garbage can linger a while longer. On average, a household can get about 30 to 40 bags out of each liner. Liners are white and made of a thick, durable plastic that is less likely to break and have a pleasant spring flower scent to cover up any noxious odors. An installation guide shows how to set up the refill bag within the Magikan system. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magikan","source_asin":"B00021REPQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00021REPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00021REPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
