window.products.push({"id":123491,"name":"Mini Washing Machine, Ultrasonic Portable Washing Machines Foldable Laundry Tub by USB Powered for Socks Underwear, Automatic Folding Clothes Washing ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A8o2BaboL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features of the mini washing machines: ️Turbine forward and reverse cleaning ️Ultrasonic high frequency cavitation ️Portable washing machine with Low noise,≤45dB ️Intelligent interactive switching: After the pulsator works for 6 minutes, it exchanges for 2 minutes of ultrasonic work. ️Anti-winding technology: the washing machine will start ultrasonic work after being wound up and down 4 times. ️Forward and backward interaction: After the wave wheel rotates forward for 20 seconds, it is switched to reverse installation for 20 seconds. ️Timed shutdown protection: The washing machine works for over 40 minutes, and the shutdown program is automatically protected. 🔔Warm Tips: 1. The mini washing machine is designed in a single-person style, suitable for personal laundry capacity, suitable for 1 kg laundry capacity, please wash in batches if you have more clothes. 2. When the portable washing machines is working, do not stay away from people. After washing, please unplug the power outlet immediately. 3. When the turbo washing machine is rotating, please do not touch the fan blades of the turbo to avoid accidents. 4. Do not dip the USB power plug into water or other liquids to avoid short circuit and burn components. 5.The small washing machines are mainly used for washing small items and therefore do not have a dryer function. 🧦Specifications of Portable Washer: - Casing Material: ABS - Material of the bucket: PP+TPE - Power Supply: USB - Input Voltage: DC 5V - Output Voltage: DC 10V - Output Power: 6W 🎁Package: 1 * Mini washing machine 1 * Foldable laundry bin 1 * User manual 1 * Double sided suction cup 1 * USB cable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A8o2BaboL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DACHUANG","source_asin":"B09KC3WC8M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KC3WC8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KC3WC8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
