window.products.push({"id":123520,"name":"RECAPS Stainless Steel Refillable Filter Reusable Pod 230ml Compatible with Nespresso Vertuoline Coffee Machines But Not All","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qDBoiBSPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The original Vertuoline pods are costly for daily use and not good for the environment.Although you can reuse your original pods, the shell of which is easily to be damaged and could just be used for several times.  That’s why we developed the stainless steel filter compatible with the Vertuoline machines, which will help you save money, be good to the environment, and enjoy your favorite coffee.   How to get a nice Espresso? Please take the following tips:   1)GRIND is Everything!  We recommend using medium or fine grinds generally. Please open a new original Nespresso Vertuoline pod, studying the grind in the pod. Or you can try some LAVAZZA , Illy or some other brands grinds to see the difference. We have tried the Lavazza and illy ground coffee , We found that the cream it produced is very similar to the original pod.  2)Pack and Press the coffee grind appropriately.  Please try several times to find the difference Espresso produced by using different Volume(usually 8-10g）of the coffee grinds in the pod, to get the best type you want.  Do not over grind the beans too fine which may come out a diluted Espresso.  Do not super press the coffee grinds like those who work in coffee shops with a commercial half-Manual Coffee Machine, just slightly press.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qDBoiBSPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RECAPS","source_asin":"B08KXH2YBG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KXH2YBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KXH2YBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
