window.products.push({"id":123523,"name":"WB30T10074 8 InchSurface Burner Element Coil By Primeswift Replace for G-E Range Replaces 911363 AP3186376 EAP243922 PS243922","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ea+Qv5xdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Replace confidently The surface burner elements, those metal components that get red-hot and generate heat, are the most important parts of any range. When the elements fail to heat properly, it's time to replace them. It's a simple procedure any electric stove owner can easily accomplish in a few minutes' time. You can usually identify a burnt-out element by blistering or small holes on the element's coils. Fix the following symptoms: The element will not heat Will not start Quality you can rely on Count on our WB30T10074 Range Surface Element Replacement for an unrivaled mix of durability, convenient functionality, and great value for money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ea+Qv5xdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"prime&swift","source_asin":"B07XCVW2DQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XCVW2DQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XCVW2DQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":123524,"name":"Ecumfy SP22YA Electric Range Burner Element Unit Set - 3 pcs WB30X254 6\" and 1 pcs WB30X253 8\" Compatible with General Electric Range Stove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a0sbBuHgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The turns are how many times the coil goes around in a circle. It has a \"Y\" style bracket. Easy to install To complete this repair, first be sure to disconnect the power from your range, and ensure the burner is cool to the touch. Then, gently remove the burner from the terminals and replace it with the new one. Important note: Please check the dimensions carefully to ensure they are suitable with your stove before ordering. If the range burner does not sit flat on your stove, make sure the connection bolts are parallel and pushed a bit down. WB30X253 8 Inch Surface Burner Element Replaces Part Numbers: 30, 325503, 4332859, 4334586, AP2027813, WB30X0253, WB30X5060, WB30X5095,WB30K10006 WB30T10071, SP21YA. WB30X254 6 Inch Surface Burner Element Replaces Part Numbers: 23, 325507, AP2027814, WB30X0254, WB30X5061, WB30X5094, 316439800, 318372210, WB30T10023 Y04000036,WB30K10005, SP12YA. Works with most top name brands: GE, Hotpoint, RCA, Roper, Amana, Magic Chef, Norge etc. Fixes the following symptoms: Element will not heat Package list: 1 PC WB30X253 4 Turns 8\": 2100 Watt, 240 Volts 3 PC WB30X254 3 Turns 6\": 1250 Watt, 240 Volts The GE brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the GE brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a0sbBuHgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecumfy","source_asin":"B08F1WJWTS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F1WJWTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F1WJWTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
