window.products.push({"id":123591,"name":"Waterdrop 4396508 Replacement for Whirlpool® 4396510, EDR5RXD1, NLC240V, PNL240V, 4396508p, 4396547, 4392857, 9010, LC400V, WF-NLC240V, 46-9010, Every","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vgSx6UjAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The replacement for 4396508 & 4396510 Whirlpool water filter, despite the affordable price, offer the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. Thanks to the 100% Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, this replacement for Kenmore 469010 refrigerator water filter is effective against various contaminants. [Advance filtration process] If you have been looking for a way to reduce harmful impurities from your drinking water, the solution is here. Waterdrop replacement for EDR5RXD1 refrigerator water filter effectively filters off contaminants from your water. These include chlorine, bad taste and odor and other suspended particles tested by the third-party laboratory. While the impurities are reduced, every beneficial mineral in your water is kept, ensuring that your body functions properly. [Perfect fit] You can now worry less about water leakages due to unfit or loose replacement refrigerator filters. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter replacement is made from an advanced industrial automation system and a precision measurement technology that ensures that you get the same fit as the original. Moreover, you need no tool to install this refrigerator water filter. Just follow the installation guidelines we have provided, and you will be done in minutes. [Top-notch filter material] Here, you are getting a significant improvement to the less-efficient charcoal filter that relies on coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell to filter water. The filter material in this filter is a 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores. [Great-tasting water] Another essential benefit of the 100% natural coconut shell carbon block is the enhanced adsorption capability. Unlike the cheap and mixed carbon block, the filter material in the Waterdrop refrigerator filter improves the overall taste of your water. [Complimentary month install stickers] You do not have to go the extra mile to monitor your refrigerator filter’s lifespan. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter is shipped with complimentary month install stickers that help track the service life at all times. Now you know when you have exhausted the 300 gallons or 6 months of pure water, depending on the water conditions. [BPA-free and food-grade materials] At Waterdrop, we prioritize your safety. This is why we have used only safe materials in this refrigerator filter, as verified by the NSF 372 certification for lead-free materials. [Purified with love] We believe everyone has the right to drink pure water wherever they are. We are not only about business; we hope to use our technology to benefit more people. A portion of every purchase you make is donated to provide children in water-scarce regions in Africa with clean, pure water. Compatible models: Whirlpool Filter 5, Kenmore Filter 5, EveryDrop Filter 5, EveryDrop 8212652, 469085, 8212652, 4392857R, 4392922, 4396508P, 4396508T, 4396509, 4396509P, 4396510P, 4396510T, 4396562, 4396563, 4396918, 46-9010, 46 9010, 46-9902, 46 9902, 9085, 46-9908, 46- 9908, 4396547, 4396163, 4396548, 4396164, 2255709, 2203980, 2305767, 2305768, 2255518, 2186444, 2203980, WF-NL240V, WF-L400V, WFL500, WF-L500, WFLC400, WFLC400V, WF-NLC250, WF-NL300, WF-l500, NLC240V, NL240, NL240V, NL300 Compatible with models: L400, L400V, LC400, LC400V, WFL400, FL400V, AQUA CREST AQF-4396508, Denali Pure WF-4396508, PWF-NL240V, WE-NLC240V, PUR NLC240V, Pure Line PL-600, PurePlus PP-RWF0500A, Clear Choice CLCH100, HDX FMW-2, Refresh R-9010, WaterSentinel WSW-2, Tier1 RWF1020, Waterfall Filter WFC1001, Aqua Fresh WF285, EXCELPURE EP-4396508, Odoga WFEK00008, EcoAqua EFF-6002A, FilterLogic FL-RF02, One Purify RFC0500A, Waterdrop WD-4396508","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vgSx6UjAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B0CDGZZPSY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CDGZZPSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CDGZZPSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
