window.products.push({"id":123653,"name":"Livtor 4 Inches Dryer Vent Cover Outdoor Louvered Exhaust Vent Cover with Aluminum Alloy Grille Screen(Includes 1 x Duct Hose Clamp)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bXAP8EOlL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"UPDATED DRYER VENT COVER: Includes 1 x 4 inches dryer vent cover with 1 x aluminum alloy grill screen, 1 x duct hose clamp, 8 screws; diameter of the vent cover mounting/opening is about 4 inches, total unit size of the vent cover is almost 6 inches x 6 inches; the \"4 Inches\" refers to the diameter of vent cover mounting/opening, not the total unit size; Therefore, please check and confirm size/diameter of vent duct you have or hole you drill before ordering for your proper use. GOOD EFFECT & GREAT PERFORMANCE: The 4 inches louvered dryer vent cover is made out of sturdy premium quality plastic material, adding the inhibitors for long service time, and preventing it from being age-faded, damaged and cracked, due to the long time exposure to sunlight; attached with aluminum alloy grill screen, anti-rusty & sturdy. MULTI-PURPOSE APPLICATION: Livtor 4 inches louvered dryer vent cover with aluminum alloy grill screen is designed for replacing your damaged or broken vent cover, fitting for 4-inch duct opening; widely used in exhausting of bathroom vents, air conditioning units, kitchen fan & vents, home wall vents and dryer vents. CONVENIENT & DEDICATED DESIGN: The louvered flapper design of the outdoor 4 inches dryer vent cover allows for getting maximum exhaust flow, open and closed quietly while exhausting through the vents; also used for preventing rain, snow, wind from entering the outdoor dryer vents; with aluminum alloy grill screen, anti-rusty and reusable, extending its service life. EASY TO CLEAN: Easy installation without requiring professional tools or assistance, finishing it in several minutes(fix it onto the external wall of your house, twist 4 screws into pre-drilled screw holes to complete it); take out the detachable flappers and aluminum alloy grill screen for cleaning. A must-have home improvement item for your storage!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bXAP8EOlL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Livtor","source_asin":"B097SFXZMT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097SFXZMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B097SFXZMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
