window.products.push({"id":123740,"name":"The Coffee Seal 2 REUSABLE COFFEE CAPSULE DISCS Refillable for VERTUOLINE & VERTUO capsules, compatible with NESPRESSO VERTUOLINE & VERTUO pods, 2 DIS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ya2owNDVL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Lead a cost-saving and eco-friendly lifestyle. Hi! I’m Joe from the Coffee Seal. Why did I decide to create the perfect-sized silicon cap for the Nesspreso Vertouline pods? Well, I was so pained by the waste of money and pollution that I was causing by buying new Nespresso Vertuoline pods and watching the old pods being tossed away. Yet, I really enjoyed the cup of coffee that the Vertuoline machine would make for me every morning... I knew I had to make a difference, and thank goodness, with a bit of research and experimentation, now there is a solution through the Coffee Seal. The Nespresso Vertuoline Pods are made well and they have the necessary bar code on them. So I experimented with different ways of reusing the pod. First I tried different foil covers but found that they wouldn’t fit right. They were either too big and would cover the barcode or too small, which made it challenging to get on and I found they would not stay on well. Finally, after many cups of coffee, I came up with the silicon cap that I felt gave the best results for that perfect cup of coffee. This is how you too can enjoy the perfect eco-friendly cup of coffee: TIPS: 1) Using store-bought already ground coffee will give you more crema. 2) If you grind the coffee at home make sure it is ground very fine to enjoy the maximum flavor and more crema. 3) Fill the capsule all the way and tap the coffee before sealing to make sure it is fully filled. Reusing your Nespresso capsule with THE COFFEE SEAL silicon caps will also give you the freedom to brew your favorite coffee brand and roast. You will now be able to brew all your favorite drinks, coffee, tea, or hot chocolate, in the most cost-efficient and Eco-friendly way!!! It is no doubt... The more you use it the faster you’ll become a pro at it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ya2owNDVL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Coffee Seal","source_asin":"B09N5JSWWV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N5JSWWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N5JSWWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
