window.products.push({"id":123796,"name":"Integra Boost RH 55% 2 Way Humidity Control (8 Gram - 10 Medium Packets) + Twin Canaries Chart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sTx89BIML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Integra’s 2-way humidity control technology responds to the environment you place it in—either releasing or absorbing moisture as needed to ensure the optimal environment for everything from your family’s favorite pantry items to those rare cigars you’ve been saving for a special occasion. All of our products are spill- and tear-resistant and biodegradable. Plus, they’re 100% salt-free—so they won’t alter the taste of your pantry items or rare cigars—and are made with food-grade approved ink. Stop playing the guessing game. Every Integra Boost pack includes a hands-free Replacement Indicator Card. When the dot on the card turns bright blue, it’s time to replace your packet. It’s that simple. Whether you live on a humid coast or in a landlocked desert, Integra products respond and adapt to the environment they’re placed in, creating optimal moisture levels with minimal work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sTx89BIML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Twin Canaries Liquid Volume Conversion Chart","source_asin":"B07MKSDSBM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MKSDSBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MKSDSBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":123797,"name":"Part Number 134792700 Electrolux Dryer Heating Element Frigidaire Affinity Heater Eimed60lss2 Eied55hiw0 Fase7073lw0 Eimed60lt3 Ffse5115pw0 Fase7073la","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tKuNCpJbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 134792700 Heating Element - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP4368653, 1482984, 7134792700, AH2349309, EA2349309, PS2349309. Heating Element Part Number 134792700 is compatible with Frigidaire, Crosley, Kenmore, Electrolux dryer. Electrolux Dryer Heating Element 134792700 is made of high-quality materials to ensure durability and long-lasting performance. Electrolux Heating Element 134792700 fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the 134792700 Dryer Heating Element? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Electrolux 134792700 Heater assembly will help if there's no heat or not enough heat, it shuts off too soon, does not start, or takes too long to dry. If you notice any signs that the heating element may be faulty, replace it to ensure optimal performance of your dryer. 💡 Frigidaire Dryer Heating Element 134792700 is an essential component of a dryer that ensures efficient and effective drying of clothes. It is responsible for generating heat efficiently during the drying cycle, ensuring that your clothes dry quickly and effectively. Electrolux Dryer Part 134792700 meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Why is my Electrolux dryer not heating up? If your dryer is not heating up, it could be due to a faulty heating element, broken thermostat, clogged lint filter, blocked dryer vent, malfunctioning control board. In addition to regular maintenance, such as cleaning the lint filter and dryer vent, it's important to make sure that the dryer is receiving the correct amount of power and that the circuit breaker is not tripped. Maintaining your dryer can prevent heating and performance issues. 💡 How do I know if my dryer heating element is broken? If the Heating Element in your dryer is broken, you may notice several signs, including a dryer that won't heat up, clothes that take longer to dry, or a dryer that overheats. You can check the heating element for damage or continuity with a multimeter to confirm if it needs to be replaced. It's important to ensure that the dryer is unplugged and the heating element is completely cool before attempting any repairs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tKuNCpJbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07R9WNBRR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R9WNBRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R9WNBRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
