window.products.push({"id":123808,"name":"LHRIVER Mini Fridge with Freezer, 3.2 cu. ft. Vintage Refrigerator with Adjustable Removable Glass Shelves, Mechanical Control, Recessed Handle, Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51loKLi4G9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Retro Look & Practical Design】 This compact refrigerator's design is modern and attractive, with rounded corners and a vintage integrated frame. The storage capacity is maximized while taking up minimal space, making it ideal for dorms, offices, bedrooms, RVs, and garages. 【Mini Fridge with Freezer】The mini fridge features 7 temperature settings, ranging from 32℉ to 50℉, that can be manually adjusted between as needed. Built in separate freezer compartment, ranging from 19.4℉ to 28.4℉, which chills your ice cream all summer. The temperature of the freezer is affected by the temperature settings of the cooler. To keep the food fresh while saving money on electricity, select the most beneficial temperature setting. 【Energy Efficient & Quiet】The R600a compressor, which has a high efficiency and low energy consumption, allows this small refrigerator to cool swiftly. Only 0.6 kilowatt-hours of power are required every day. Furthermore, noise levels of less than 42 decibels, which is comparable to a quiet rural environment, ensuring a good night's sleep. 【Crisper Drawer and Removable Shelves】A crisper drawer is included to keep your greens and fruits fresh and juicy. With detachable shelves, the storage area may be designed to meet the requirements of the user. Arrange these shelves whatever you like, and you'll be surprised at how much it can hold. 【User-friendly Details】The mini refrigerator features adjustable leveling legs to help it balance on an uneven floor. Besides, the hinge makes closing doors easy, allowing you to open at wide angles without bouncing back and causing a pinch. This small fridge has a recessed door handle on the top that prevents bumping and enhances its appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51loKLi4G9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LHRIVER","source_asin":"B0B6VRKL74","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6VRKL74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6VRKL74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
