window.products.push({"id":123882,"name":"Beaquicy WD15X10014 WD15X10011 Water Inlet Valve - Replacement for G-E Hot-point Dishwasher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D6lYNgDQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"metal 【𝙋𝙍𝙊𝘿𝙐𝘾𝙏 𝘿𝙀𝙎𝘾𝙍𝙄𝙋𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉】:The WD15X10014 Dishwasher Water Inlet Valve is suitable for dishwashers and controls the water supply to the dishwasher.It is located behind the lower kickboard in the lower right or lower left corner. Water Inlet Valve WD15X10014 has a 3/8\" internal threaded entrance. It operates on 120v. Beaquicy WD15X10014 WD15X10011 dishwasher water inlet valve is made of high quality metal material and ABS plastic for excellent durability and reliability. 【𝙋𝙍𝙊𝘿𝙐𝘾𝙏 𝙄𝙉𝘾𝙇𝙐𝘿𝙀𝙎】:Includes 1 x WD15X10014 Dishwasher Water Inlet Valve.The connecting solenoid on the valve opens and closes the 3.8\" water inlet of the dishwasher's water inlet valve based on the amount of water required.If your dishwasher leaks, doesn't add water, doesn't add enough water, and doesn't wash dishes properly, you need to replace it with a new WD15X10014 water inlet valve. 【𝟯𝟲𝟱 𝘿𝘼𝙔𝙎 𝙒𝘼𝙍𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙏𝙔】:WD15X10014 WD15X10011 Dishwasher Water Inlet Valve supports 365 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 【𝙃𝙄𝙂𝙃 𝘾𝙊𝙈𝙋𝘼𝙏𝙄𝘽𝙄𝙇𝙄𝙏𝙔】:Water Inlet Valve WD15X10014 can replacement for G-E, Hot-point Dishwasher.Replaces for WD15X10011, AP5632416, 2309993, EAP3654179, PS3654179, GSC3500D35BB, GSC3500D35WW, GSC3500D45BB, GSC3500D45WW, GSC3500V00BB, GSC3500V00WW, PDWT380V50SS, HDA2000V00BB, GDWT368V55SS, HDA2100V35BB, GDWT368V00SS, PDWT180V50SS, GSD2300V00BB, GSD2300V00WW, GSD2300V35BB, GSD2300V35WW, GSD2301V00BB, GSD2301V00WW, etc. 【𝙀𝘼𝙎𝙔 𝙏𝙊 𝙄𝙉𝙎𝙏𝘼𝙇𝙇】:Unplug and turn off the water supply to the dishwasher before servicing,and wear work gloves to protect your hands. The installation of the WD15X10014 Water Inlet Valve is very simple, and the tools required include a screwdriver and a socket set. It is worth noting that after replacing parts, check whether the water inlet valve leaks, and if there is no leakage, the replacement is completed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D6lYNgDQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0887RN8QN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0887RN8QN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0887RN8QN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
