window.products.push({"id":123919,"name":"Aerolatte Microwave Milk Frother Jug, Creates Up to 3-Cups of Froth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qDb8lv6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Aerolatte’s microwave milk frothier jug, with an ample 11. 5-Ounce Capacity, aerates and warms up to 3-cups of froth quickly. Its unique angled bottom is specially designed to work together with Aerolatte’s original milk frothier (sold separately) to churn and aerate thicker, richer foam faster. Compact and microwave safe, contents can be warmed gently. It’s easy and fun for everyone to use, and more compact and economical than espresso machines. Easily froth all types of milk, from whole, skim or Goat milk, to hemp, almond, soy, cashew, coconut, and other non dairy milk. Simply add milk into the carafe, submerge the milk frother’s whisk end and hold its power button to froth, about 30-60 seconds or until desired consistency is achieved. Pour any remaining un-frothed milk into the beverage, then gently float froth on top. Add flavorings before frothing, if desired. It makes afternoon snack time more fun and is a great addition to coffee accessories to transform fresh-brewed coffee into specialty Coffee drinks. Great for cappuccino, cafe au Latte, caramel macchiato, mocha, Irish Coffee or iced coffee. Elevate hot chocolate from ordinary to extraordinary or finish craft cocktails with panache. Made from BPA-free plastic, Aerolatte’s milk frothier jug is versatile, microwave safe, and easy to use. Hand wash in warm, soapy water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qDb8lv6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"aerolatte","source_asin":"B009CZS98Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-123919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009CZS98Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B009CZS98Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
